# --- Vercel Web Analytics ---
# Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel project dashboard (Analytics tab).
# Client pageviews ship via FunnelAnalytics when deployed on Vercel.

# --- PostHog (product analytics + session replay) ---
# Project settings → Project API Key
# US cloud: https://us.i.posthog.com
# EU cloud: https://eu.i.posthog.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com
# Optional server-only key (defaults to NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY)
# POSTHOG_API_KEY=

# --- Lead delivery (consultation form + checklist lead magnet) ---
# Cascade: webhook -> Resend -> FormSubmit fallback. In production set at least
# one of the first two, or every lead rides on FormSubmit (silent-loss risk if
# the inbox never confirmed the first submission).
# CONSULTATION_WEBHOOK_URL=
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# Auto-reply to the lead and checklist pack delivery only fire when BOTH
# RESEND_API_KEY and CONSULTATION_FROM_EMAIL (verified domain sender, e.g.
# "Dali <hello@daliagents.com>") are set. The resend.dev default sender can
# only deliver to the Resend account owner.
# CONSULTATION_FROM_EMAIL=
